# The built module. It is an artifact, it is megabytes, and nobody reviews a
# binary diff — so it is built from this source instead: by `make`, by the
# server's acceptance suite, and by anyone who wants to install it.
plugin.wasm
# The plugin package `make package` produces.
obelo-plugin-discord.zip
# The signature covers the built module, so it is an artifact too, and so is
# any package zip (the name `make package` uses, or a versioned one).
plugin.sig.json
*.zip
